  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;ENERGYTECH INC.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"EnergyTech Inc. is the company behind the State of Charge Estimation Device, known for its innovative technology in energy storage and management."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. MARIA HERNANDEZ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Maria Hernandez is the Lead Researcher at EnergyTech Inc., responsible for the development of the State of Charge Estimation Device."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;US PATENT 11150306&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"US Patent 11150306 is a significant legal filing that marks a major milestone in the field of energy storage and management, involving the State of Charge Estimation Device."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENERGY STORAGE SOLUTIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Energy Storage Solutions is an industry expert that acknowledges the potential of the State of Charge Estimation Device to transform the energy storage landscape."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOHN SMITH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"John Smith is the CEO of Energy Storage Solutions, providing insights on the potential impact of the State of Charge Estimation Device."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STATE OF CHARGE ESTIMATION DEVICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The State of Charge Estimation Device is a cutting-edge device designed to accurately determine the remaining capacity of a battery, playing a pivotal role in significant filings and energy management."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ECOPULSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"EcoPulse is a California-based tech firm that developed the state of charge estimation device used in the funeral ceremony."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. RACHEL KIM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Rachel Kim is the CEO of EcoPulse, explaining the versatility of the state of charge estimation device in the context of the funeral ceremony."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AGNES THOMPSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Agnes Thompson is a beloved community leader whose funeral ceremony included the use of a state of charge estimation device, reflecting her values of innovation and sustainability."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JAMES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"James is the grandson of Agnes Thompson and an engineer at EcoPulse, who conceived the idea to incorporate the state of charge estimation device into the funeral ceremony."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ST. MARY'S CHURCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"St. Mary's Church is the venue for the funeral ceremony of Agnes Thompson, located in downtown Los Angeles."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CALIFORNIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"California is the state where EcoPulse, the developer of the state of charge estimation device, is based."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOS ANGELES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Los Angeles is the city where the funeral ceremony of Agnes Thompson took place."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ELECTRIC HEARSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An electric hearse equipped with a state of charge estimation device was used in the funeral ceremony of Agnes Thompson."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REVEREND MICHAEL BROWN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Reverend Michael Brown officiated the funeral ceremony of Agnes Thompson."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FUNERAL CEREMONY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The funeral ceremony of Agnes Thompson included the use of a state of charge estimation device, reflecting her values of innovation and sustainability."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INNOVATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Innovation is a key value of both Agnes Thompson and the state of charge estimation device, reflecting the integration of modern technology in traditional ceremonies."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUSTAINABILITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sustainability is another key value of Agnes Thompson, reflected in the use of the state of charge estimation device in the funeral ceremony."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ELECTRIC VEHICLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Electric vehicles, including the hearse, utilize the state of charge estimation device to ensure optimal battery performance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DATA FROM THE DEVICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Data from the state of charge estimation device revealed that the hearse's battery level remained above 80% throughout the ceremony, ensuring a smooth and dignified procession."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REAL-TIME MONITORING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The state of charge estimation device provided real-time monitoring capabilities, ensuring the hearse's battery remained at optimal levels during the ceremony."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CARBON FOOTPRINT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Carbon footprint is a measure of the environmental impact of the event, which is being reduced."&lt;SEP&gt;"The state of charge estimation device helped reduce the carbon footprint of the funeral ceremony by enabling the hearse to travel an additional 10 miles on a single charge."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EVENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The event is described as having a reduced carbon footprint due to improved vehicle performance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The event is described as having a reduced carbon footprint due to improved vehicle performance.")</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;10 MILES ON A SINGLE CHARGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"10 miles on a single charge is a feature of the vehicle or technology used at the event, improving its performance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0365</data>
    </node>
